<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Frigate Duel in the Scotia Sea, 2023</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;This scenario assumes tensions have recently increased between Argentina and the United Kingdom, partly because of the recent discovery of large deposits of valuable minerals in the undersea basins south of the Falkland Islands.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;-------------------------------------------------------&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;Be aware that your WRA is currently set at Weapons Hold.&amp;nbsp; Weapons will not fire automatically.&amp;nbsp; You will need to manually target and fire weapons, assuming it becomes necessary to do so.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;This scenario assumes that Argentina has replaced its aging destroyer fleet with a quartet of fast frigates based on the LCS &lt;EM&gt;Independence&lt;/EM&gt; design.&amp;nbsp; The LCS hull makes an excellent framework for a variety of small future warship classes.&amp;nbsp; As one can see, by sacrificing modularity, one can easily add an acceptable loadout of surface-to-air and surface-to-surface missiles.&amp;nbsp; The large hangar allows the addition of an anti-submarine warfare helicopter and two drones capable of surveillence and light anti-surface missions.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;A delta template .ini file has been included in the .zip file to assist in updating the scenario to any future versions of the database.&amp;nbsp; &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;Scenario Author: Mark Gellis&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
  <Complexity>1</Complexity>
  <Difficulty>3</Difficulty>
  <ScenSetting>Scotia Sea</ScenSetting>
  <ScenDate>2023</ScenDate>
